                        <h2 class="text-base font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight">Tetris Cascade</h2>
                        <p class="text-xxs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mt-1.5 font-medium">Left/Right: Shift piece lateral rows.<br>Up Arrow: Cycle rotational orientation.<br>Down Arrow: Accelerate drop fall rate parameters.</p>
                    </div>
