                    <button onclick="bootTetrisEngineInstance()" class="w-full py-2.5 bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs rounded-lg transition-all shadow shadow-black">Reboot Engine</button>
